data: {"text": "Here are several real **tiger photos from the web** (actual images, not generated):\n\n**Wild tiger visuals — examples include:**\n- Bengal tiger resting on the ground.   \n- Tiger lying beside a tree trunk.   \n- Tiger walking through a forest setting.   \n- Tiger moving on rocks in its habitat.   \n- Close-up tiger portrait in a natural setting.   \n- Tiger prowling through lush undergrowth.   \n- Tiger walking across forest floor.   \n- Tiger in partial shadow with intense gaze. \n\nIf you want more photos (e.g., from free sites like **Pixabay** or **Unsplash**), I can pull and show additional large galleries you can browse and download."}
